        "text": "《原神》3.6版本PV：「盛典与慧业」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/03/10/237301566/2dde1de2dfb1abec4b9c256d3ef17fe3_8315680884609167689.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2023年3月31日</color>\n生命伴随痛苦与欢愉，在历史的长河中繁衍不息。\n生如逆旅，爱与美即为良药，智慧亦然。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=kYWbXZed7us"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》剧情PV-「花与美梦」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/09/326985891/b1b2af364b3e58fe571fc88dd9d6ca42_1042511593019924119.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年11月7日</color>\n可曾见过比烟火更加绚丽的花朵，可曾有过比美梦更加温柔的记忆。\n日月轮回升起，草木铭记此刻。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=VrBbOi6cJWs"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "展示页",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "纳西妲，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/16da4803280c7a787aff439d50dc51b5_6600085906892192369.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年10月27日</color>\n「大家都很快乐呢。太好了。」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "纳西妲，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/71d227caa117a70399d723cc4c7e1ee0_1537229337455923109.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年10月27日</color>\n时间过得真快呢，须弥城里的树木又抽出了新芽。\n转眼间，生命的年轮就多了一道刻痕。\n这些泡泡里面盛着的是我给大家准备的美梦。虽然梦境易碎，或许醒来的一瞬间就会被遗忘。\n但梦醒后心底残留的那份悸动，却能给予迷途之人抽芽生长的勇气。"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "妮露，生日快乐！"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/02/05/326985891/c3ec088628559068ce8f64d5247d6687_3145228288536374751.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年12月3日</color>\n「斯露莎老师，这支新舞是以花神之舞为灵感创作的，请您多多指点…」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4912,
        "name": "娜布·玛莉卡塔",
        "desc": "<p>花神，大慈树王与赤王的挚友。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/df77c80b17526e9aa7c4e365b369b21d_6115228951106138458.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "娜布•玛莉卡塔创造了灵光，后者之后变成了神鸟，西摩格。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4910,
        "name": "大慈树王",
        "desc": "<p>初代草神，也是智慧之神。娜布·玛莉卡塔与赤王的挚友。为了不让世界树继续遭受禁忌知识的污染，大慈树王从世界树中被彻底抹除。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/07/31/59155606/283cea7d534af180f1561b619e60e0f7_6776115350797876271.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "大慈树王将灵光变成了神鸟西摩格，令其守护森林。诞生于西摩格的花灵，是大慈树王的眷属。由于大慈树王的相关信息已从",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7087,
        "name": "世界树",
        "desc": "<p>世界树可被视作一棵向下生长而非向上的大树，它蕴含着从古至今世间所有的知识与智慧。地脉如同世界树的根系，纵横交错于大地之上，汲取着世间的记忆。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/06/326985891/aa06aa829f5a3a926aef88750adb81f2_6223183224723224472.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "中被抹去，如今花灵被视作",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7471,
        "name": "布耶尔",
        "desc": "<p>须弥的草之魔神</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/27/132559235/eefeae3e6ad6f9081dc2a39d89a720fd_256420061147755822.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的眷属。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4780,
        "name": "厄歌莉娅",
        "desc": "<p>枫丹前代水神，殒殁于500年前的大灾厄中。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/20/a5b8d23dd3fbe0969cc3ebce78f9c29f_8021351765588020911.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在厄歌莉娅死去后，她的身体化为了纯净的甘露。西摩格喝了甘露的水，并散成了许多碎片。从这些碎片中，花灵便由此诞生了。\n西摩格\n一只神鸟，花灵便诞生于它的身躯之中。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7033,
        "name": "兰那罗",
        "desc": "<p>大慈树王的眷属和森之民。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/03/326985891/960461c3413ef1a52a3d848543f4ef41_517787607492439052.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "草神的眷属。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5744,
        "name": "戴因斯雷布",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亚末代宫廷卫队的「末光之剑」，蒙受了来自天空岛的不死诅咒。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/06/26/59155606/385d810ab3166799fc6ea831619f5ef6_5129310545559016295.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在灾厄爆发期间，戴因斯雷布曾与最初的花灵，祖尔宛并肩作战。\n旅行者的血亲\n在灾厄暴发期间，血亲曾与最初的花灵，祖尔宛并肩作战。\n矫论团\n矫论团欺骗花灵以获取「灵光绝唱」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 20,
        "name": "旅行者",
        "desc": "从世界之外漂流而来的旅行者，被神带走血亲，自此踏上寻找七神之路。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/04f769b0b1671b5ffbbafefd7286b4b2_8705621070531496665.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "勇者，斯露莎的「谒颂主」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名花灵"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3829,
        "name": "祖尔宛",
        "desc": "<p>祖尔宛是诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，被认为是最初的花灵。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/0987bc70b51b17406a88efddf714172b_373159445615742976.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
