      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3826,
        "name": "米希尔",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，米希尔是荆棘之眷属。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/17/88072335/e5391d67413dbbaa939883880fe035d0_1568365135425999917.png",
