        "epId": 3824,
        "name": "瑟法娜",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，瑟法娜是看守净觉花花圃的花灵。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/b971abb5511eb82efd51da203a999c4d_8434618369756541487.png",
