      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3823,
        "name": "贾尔贾",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，贾尔贾喜欢设计名为「浮光鸣召」的赛道挑战。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/bb411ee24c98ae2de8176fd0003e9335_4267994165835671157.png",
