      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3828,
        "name": "菲多赫",
        "desc": "<p>诞生于甘露花海的一只花灵，菲多赫是看守甘露池的花灵。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/10/88072335/e6c92c89bba136838a50ad3d50f8ef78_2769534760381264740.png",
